        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-lung-stereotyped-branching-modes-audit-v3-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-lung-stereotyped-branching-modes-audit-v3-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-3>,
